{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0074_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "c485ed29925488871d1d313ba058395b1e64ad06f1355a54d9ea0de2c6acd66f", "ja": "あ、間違えた。\nいらっしゃいませ～、ゴチューモンをどーぞ！", "zh": "啊，讲错了。\n欢迎光临～请点餐～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
