{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0074_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c3bee7e85df4646bd8d03271e7e85e2ea5032ba24ba5e141a731fc079b27fd5b", "ja": "まあいい。でも亜美、そこまで言ったからには……\n今度の新衣装お披露目公演、期待させてもらうからな？", "zh": "算了。不过亚美，既然你都说到这个地步了……\n下次你的新服装首次亮相公演，我可是会好好期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0074_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "3dfeb0fa114ceaf602e3a2300a809624c34b2a1fc7e89a0091bebbb66f9093ba", "ja": "えっ？　どゆこと、兄ちゃん？", "zh": "咦？大哥哥，什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
