{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0074_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "9dcc620ff6da978534a4eec5aad0b28d45265fc579940e86a413584e7481bc08", "ja": "おっ！？　なるほど、そう来ましたか～。\nさすが兄ちゃん、抜け毛がありませんなぁ？", "zh": "哦！？原来如此，来这招啊～\n不愧是大哥哥，「无鞋可击」呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0074_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c942a6f72d02e701f7825b6cc219d6eae8e78173939154de9969ef8bdb7b0a23", "ja": "そ、それは……\nなくはないが……。", "zh": "那、那倒……\n也不是没有啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
